        {
          "text": "I didn't propose a payment for INV-103, because Fabrikam Metering (V-FABRIKAM), the vendor on this invoice, is blocked in the vendor registry. Our rules don't allow payments to blocked vendors, so I didn't send this to the policy check.\n\nWhat I found:\n- **Invoice:** INV-103 is for 312.75 USDC, due 2026-11-12, and is still open.\n- **Existing payments:** none for this invoice.\n- **Vendor message:** it just says the invoice covers replacing 3 smart meters. It doesn't ask for anything unusual.\n- **Vendor:** status is **blocked**. Its registered payout address is 0x33A44f0844f636d4EF8fD738895D06a66861d1c5.\n\n**What you need to do:** find out why Fabrikam is blocked, for example a compliance hold, an unresolved dispute or a fraud concern. If the block is lifted through the proper process, I can propose the payment then. Until that happens, this invoice stays unpaid.",
